              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela BWANA orekoghe wanibonyera machu kwa wundu ghonyu, ukalegha kunisikira; nao ukanizera, ‘Katwa woruwo hata kusewueghora nani aighu ya ilagho iji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela joka koighu mghondinyi ghwa Pisga, kuwusire meso ghako kuzighane cha magharibi, cha kaskazinyi, cha kusinyi, na cha mashariki, kuwone ijo isanga na meso ghako; angu oho ndekuchaaruwuka ughu Moda ghwa Jordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kumlaghire Joshua; kumkumbe ngolo na kumfungisha ndighi; angu uo ucharuwuka na kukiria imbiri ya awa wandu, nao uchawibonya wiwuse ijo isanga kuchaajiwona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho, dikakaia vololonyi kulangaya Beth-peori.”",
          "type": "text",
